https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T21:09:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T21:09:43Z","body":"I noticed a mistake in `post.glsl` (glow for Compatibility): Because glow is being applied before the nonlinear sRGB -> linear conversion, `white` needs to be transformed to nonlinear sRGB encoding first, otherwise there will be a mismatch between the `white` that is used in the tonemap function and the `white` that is used for screen blending on nonlinaer sRGB encoded values.\r\n\r\nI've pushed a fix to correct this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358143155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3362241104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3362241104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3362241104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IZ7pQ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T17:16:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T19:31:53Z","body":"In yesterday's rendering meeting we discussed my proposed \"Legacy mode\" project setting for `Environment` effects and decided it was best to remove it from this PR. We came to this decision based on the following:\r\n\r\n- The maintenance cost of a legacy mode for glow and other environment effects is too high, given we would be looking at a timeframe of 5-10 years before Godot 5.\r\n- Few people would test legacy mode during development, so it would be prone to bugs and becoming broken in the future.\r\n- If some projects must maintain the exact visual behaviour of the existing environment effects, these game developers can create a custom build of the engine that uses the old effect behaviour.\r\n\r\nWhile the last point is not ideal for some projects, our hope is that the new environment effects behaviour will be as capable as the existing behaviour. This means that there will be a pain point from upgrading because parameters will need to be readjusted to match the new behaviour. But our expectation is visuals that are as good, if not better, should be achievable with the new behaviour.\r\n\r\nI will update the PR and proposal description to not include the original \"Legacy mode\" proposal.\r\n\r\nI have pushed a new version of the PR and completed my work removing the \"Legacy mode\" from the code, so the PR is now again ready for review and testing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3362241104/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3363333630","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3363333630","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3363333630,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IeGX-","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T21:48:52Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T21:48:52Z","body":"> Tested locally on various demos in all renderers, it works as expected. Code and documentation look good to me.\r\n> \r\n> Once this PR is merged, we should make sure to mention the changes in the migration guide, such as `tonemap_white` being clamped to `1.0` or greater as well as the new glow defaults.\r\n\r\nThanks for testing @Calinou! Yes, the migration guide notes will be important for this one.\r\n\r\n@Repiteo: I think @clayjohn is also planning on reviewing this PR, as he's currently working on glow updates as well, which could possibly influence some of the nuance in this PR (I'm thinking stuff relating to default changes, specifically). Clay: Let us know if you're fine just going with Calinou's approval.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3363333630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366308998","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3366308998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3366308998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IpcyG","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","recei