l_url":"https://github.com/gtibo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T13:38:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T13:39:13Z","body":"Hello @allenwp \r\nI am currently gathering images and videos for the version 4.6 page.\r\n\r\nI retrieved two images from your PR to illustrate this new feature on the release page. Unfortunately, the images on GitHub are not in the correct format and aspect ratio (HD 16:9). Do you happen to have any higher-quality images illustrating your PR? \r\n\r\nPreferably, by presenting a clear side-by-side comparison, as you did with the street lamp.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1640\" height=\"621\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed5a7b52-be03-499f-a425-1fa237fe4143\" />\r\n\r\nFor reference:\r\nRelease page draft: https://gtibo.github.io/godot-4.6-release-page/\r\nAnd github repo: https://github.com/gtibo/godot-4.6-release-page\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3749607839/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752120691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3752120691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3752120691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fpNFz","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T23:08:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T23:08:11Z","body":"Sure, I can try and whip something up in the next week or two. I'm not the best for art/related stuff... so if you decide you'd like to make your own comparison, please message me on RocketChat and I can give you the exact configurations to use for screenshots that will highlight the changes!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752120691/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3759350843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3759350843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3759350843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gEyQ7","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T10:35:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T11:05:37Z","body":"Hello! I am trying 4.6.rc1 and the glow intensity has totally increased compared to 4.5:\r\n\r\n4.6.rc1\r\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"511\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-15 170227\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98df1649-7545-46fa-91bb-60f04aa55ea7\" />\r\n\r\n4.5.1:\r\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"524\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-15 170438\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d773fd5c-7e65-47b2-888d-a6f932c63c94\" />\r\n\r\nDo you know what is the factor by which I need to decrease the glow to get back to the original intensity? or should I just eyeball it?\r\n\r\nEDIT: if I understand well, I just need to change the glow blending to softlight if I want the same effect as before?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3759350843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3760052568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671#issuecomment-3760052568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110671","id":3760052568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gHdlY","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T13:35:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T17:36:56Z","body":"If you have HDR 2D enabled, then yes, changing to soft light and changing the levels and intensity back to their 4.5.1 values will give you the same effect.\r\n\r\n**Changes to default values:**\r\n4.5.1 | 4.6\r\n--|--\r\nglow_levels = { 0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0 } | glow_levels = { 0.0, 0.8, 0.4, 0.1, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0 };\r\nglow_intensity = 1.0 | glow_intensity = 0.3\r\nglow_blend_mode = Soft Light | glow_blend_mode = Screen\r\n\r\nIf HDR 2D is disabled (the default for new projects), then there is no way to get the exact soft light behaviour from 4.5.1 and you will need to eyeball it. I recommend using the new default screen blend mode instead of soft light because soft light removes the glow effect when blending against dark backgrounds, which is typically not a desirable behaviour for a glow effect, even though it was previously the default.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3760052568/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]